####
# Extension Testing
####

# Test database files - place production DB copies in /test-data/ for testing
# The README.md in test-data/ is tracked, but database files are ignored
/test-data/*.sqlite
/test-data/*.sqlite-wal
/test-data/*.sqlite-shm
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm